  "summary": "<p>Today, President Donald J. Trump announced one of the largest steel plants in American history: a $15 billion Mesabi Metallics mill in Iowa. The project will create 1,750 permanent Iowa jobs, support up to 6,000 construction jobs, and is projected to add $95 billion to the U.S. economy over the next decade. The mill will [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/mined-melted-and-poured-in-america-president-trump-reverses-years-of-anti-mining-policy/\">Mined, Melted, and Poured in America: President Trump Reverses Years of Anti-Mining Policy</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
